{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"code","value":"const useIsomorphicLayoutEffect: (effect, inputs?) => void;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/form/blob/main/packages/preact-form/src/useIsomorphicLayoutEffect.ts#L3","children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/preact-form/src/useIsomorphicLayoutEffect.ts:3"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Accepts a function that contains imperative, possibly effectful code.\nUse this to read layout from the DOM and synchronously re-render.\nUpdates scheduled inside "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"useLayoutEffect"},{"type":"text","value":" will be flushed synchronously, after all DOM mutations but before the browser has a chance to paint.\nPrefer the standard "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"useEffect"},{"type":"text","value":" hook when possible to avoid blocking visual updates."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"parameters","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Parameters"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"effect","children":[{"type":"text","value":"effect"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"EffectCallback"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Imperative function that can return a cleanup function"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"inputs","children":[{"type":"text","value":"inputs?"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Inputs"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"If present, effect will only activate if the values in the list change (using ===)."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"returns","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Returns"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"void"}]}],"headings":[{"id":"parameters","text":"Parameters","level":2},{"id":"effect","text":"effect","level":3},{"id":"inputs","text":"inputs?","level":3},{"id":"returns","text":"Returns","level":2}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n```ts\nconst useIsomorphicLayoutEffect: (effect, inputs?) => void;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/preact-form/src/useIsomorphicLayoutEffect.ts:3](https://github.com/TanStack/form/blob/main/packages/preact-form/src/useIsomorphicLayoutEffect.ts#L3)\n\nAccepts a function that contains imperative, possibly effectful code.\nUse this to read layout from the DOM and synchronously re-render.\nUpdates scheduled inside `useLayoutEffect` will be flushed synchronously, after all DOM mutations but before the browser has a chance to paint.\nPrefer the standard `useEffect` hook when possible to avoid blocking visual updates.\n\n## Parameters\n\n### effect\n\n`EffectCallback`\n\nImperative function that can return a cleanup function\n\n### inputs?\n\n`Inputs`\n\nIf present, effect will only activate if the values in the list change (using ===).\n\n## Returns\n\n`void`\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: useIsomorphicLayoutEffect\ntitle: useIsomorphicLayoutEffect\n---\n\n```ts\nconst useIsomorphicLayoutEffect: (effect, inputs?) => void;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/preact-form/src/useIsomorphicLayoutEffect.ts:3](https://github.com/TanStack/form/blob/main/packages/preact-form/src/useIsomorphicLayoutEffect.ts#L3)\n\nAccepts a function that contains imperative, possibly effectful code.\nUse this to read layout from the DOM and synchronously re-render.\nUpdates scheduled inside `useLayoutEffect` will be flushed synchronously, after all DOM mutations but before the browser has a chance to paint.\nPrefer the standard `useEffect` hook when possible to avoid blocking visual updates.\n\n## Parameters\n\n### effect\n\n`EffectCallback`\n\nImperative function that can return a cleanup function\n\n### inputs?\n\n`Inputs`\n\nIf present, effect will only activate if the values in the list change (using ===).\n\n## Returns\n\n`void`\n"}
